@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5080

### Health checks
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Ready check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Reference data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/accounts

### Categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories

### Filtered transaction page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions?accountId=1&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-03-31&search=demo&page=1&pageSize=10&sort=date&direction=desc

### Activity report across the complete date range
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/activity?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-03-31&accountId=1

### Create a synthetic expense; save the returned id for the following requests
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-10",
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "payee": "[DEMO] Request file purchase",
  "memo": "Synthetic portfolio sample",
  "amount": -14.25
}

### Read a transaction and copy its ETag header before editing
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/11

### Update example; replace id and If-Match with the current response values
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/transactions/11
If-Match: "1"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-04-10",
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "payee": "[DEMO] Updated request file purchase",
  "memo": "Synthetic portfolio sample",
  "amount": -14.25
}

### Review consumed Kafka event metadata without retrieving transaction payloads
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/events/receipts?limit=20
